cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ilang-openclaw, please cite it as below."
title: "iLang skills and plugins for OpenClaw, Hermes and other AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Ten instruction-only skills and two OpenClaw plugins written in the iLang
  protocol. The skills are plain text with no dependencies and work in any
  agent that loads a SKILL.md: text de-AI rewriting in four languages, Chinese
  public-account writing, dead-site recovery, prompt rewriting and
  compression, product research and SEO automation for cross-border sellers,
  and a US class-action settlement tracker. The plugins register tools and
  hooks inside the OpenClaw runtime.
type: software
